 "summary": {
  "headline": "Max Estates Q1 FY27 pre-sales of ~Rs 1,100 crore (5x YoY); consol PAT Rs 8 crore; no sales guidance given.",
  "overview": "Residential pre-sales were about Rs 1,100 crore, up 5x YoY, with Terraces Phase-1 in Estate 361 (Rs 500 crore) fully sold and sustenance sales of Rs 600 crore. Collections were about Rs 575 crore, and management reiterated that residential projects are funded without incremental debt. Consolidated revenue was Rs 52 crore, EBITDA Rs 8 crore, PBT Rs 11 crore and PAT Rs 8 crore, with elevated sales and marketing spend tied to launches. Management declined to give FY27 pre-sales guidance, citing volatile conditions, though it did give a collections and OCF range. ICRA assigned a first-time A+ (stable) issuer rating.</overview>\n<parameter name=\"financial_highlights\">[{\"metric\":\"Residential pre-sales\",\"value\":\"~Rs 1,100 crore\",\"change\":\"5x YoY\"},{\"metric\":\"Collections\",\"value\":\"~Rs 575 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Consol revenue\",\"value\":\"Rs 52 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Consol EBITDA\",\"value\":\"Rs 8 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Consol PBT\",\"value\":\"Rs 11 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Consol PAT\",\"value\":\"Rs 8 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Lease rental income (Max Towers, Max House, Max Square)\",\"value\":\"Rs 40 crore\",\"change\":\"+5% YoY\"},{\"metric\":\"Max Asset Services revenue\",\"value\":\"Rs 15 crore\",\"change\":\"+16% YoY\"},{\"metric\":\"Gross debt (incl. LRD borrowings of Rs 934 crore)\",\"value\":\"Rs 1,960 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Cash and cash equivalents\",\"value\":\"Rs 1,727 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Net debt\",\"value\":\"Rs 234 crore\",\"change\":\"\"}]",
  "segments": [
   {
    "name": "Residential",
    "commentary": "Pre-sales of ~Rs 1,100 crore, split roughly 50:50 between new launch (Terraces Phase-1, Rs 500 crore) and sustenance (Rs 600 crore). Total launched portfolio revenue potential Rs 17,500 crore, of which Rs 13,500 crore sold and contracted with Rs 3,500 crore collected."
   },
   {
    "name": "Commercial annuity",
    "commentary": "Max Towers, Max House and Max Square at 100% occupancy, 1.2 million sq ft; lease rental income Rs 40 crore (+5% YoY). Max Towers latest lease at Rs 156/sq ft/month vs Rs 132 weighted average."
   },
   {
    "name": "Max Asset Services",
    "commentary": "Revenue Rs 15 crore in Q1, up 16% YoY."
   }
  ],
